        { "key": "basics", "title": "Complete the Basics tab", "instruction": "Create a new resource group **rg-web-dev**, name the VM **vm-web-01**, choose **(Europe) West Europe**, the **Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS** image and the **Standard_B2s** size. Keep **SSH public key** authentication and allow only **SSH (22)** and **HTTP (80)** inbound.", "hint": "Choose Create new in the Resource group list to type the new name. The size and image lists are on the Basics tab.", "explanation": "The image decides the operating system, the size decides CPU and memory - and therefore cost.", "targetId": "vm-wizard", "rules": [
